    "original_failure": "before-quit joined StartupFence.close(), which awaited acquisitions without cancelling the execFile helpers.",
    "correction": [
      "One AbortSignal reaches pending CLI commands from the startup fence.",
      "The command owner waits for the execFile callback and close; a failed spawn without a PID is handled separately.",
      "Cancellation and a command deadline request SIGTERM, escalate to SIGKILL and retain an explicit termination-unknown failure if close is not confirmed.",
      "All discovery helpers and owned-startup preparation are joined before propagation; late-resource cleanup and reentrant close remain owned.",
      "An existing shared background daemon deliberately keeps its independent lifetime."
    ],
